```sql
--Description: To view deliveries together with who faced them and the runs they produced, we must combine the two source tables: ball_by_ball (contains striker id) and batsman_scored (contains runs_scored).  They can be matched uniquely on match_id, over_id, ball_id, and innings_no.  Selecting a sample of 20 rows lets us verify the link.
SELECT bb.match_id,
       bb.over_id,
       bb.ball_id,
       bb.striker,
       bs.runs_scored,
       bb.innings_no
FROM ball_by_ball AS bb
JOIN batsman_scored AS bs
  ON bb.match_id   = bs.match_id
 AND bb.over_id    = bs.over_id
 AND bb.ball_id    = bs.ball_id
 AND bb.innings_no = bs.innings_no
LIMIT 20;
```
